        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Hei kandih ryanra puiram khou hei",
            "Kauthanc mei nun lung pui ram gai",
            "Ai nkhuan e Aguang jisu",
            "Kandi ram gai khang suang .",
            "",
            "Nang ramgai ta khuan e",
            "Than mei nun lung pui ram ;",
            "Rianrapui ram khou hei",
            "Khuan ngam mak khe raguang .",
            "",
            "2. Ringmei le than liangmeipu khrista",
            "Nang zei ruina thuak lou khou rui",
            "Nang guang bam aniu ding huam ma",
            "Thuan bamni tingsang jang .",
            "",
            "3. Theimei pang banthai ram ta khuan e",
            "Raguang rui dam than lou pui ram",
            "Ring suang mei thing bang lim gaimei,",
            "Neiriu suang ganpui ram .",
            "",
            "4. He zaat guai ram kaguai na kaipou",
            "Guang kaguai na guang poubaomei",
            "Zai gut lou o, nang ram gai khou",
            "Thei dat makpui ram khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
